3970..4047 Comment "/// Winding a composite is summing the windings (cubical\'s `winding-hom`), by"
4048..4122 Comment "/// induction on the first loop, written last because a recursion descends"
4123..4194 Comment "/// its last parameter, and summed with `wind(q)` first because the sum"
4195..4270 Comment "/// descends its second summand: `here(wind(q))` on the empty word, and the"
4271..4344 Comment "/// recursive call carried along `up` or `down`. The checker accepts that"
4345..4419 Comment "/// body and the kernel refuses it, the fault of #424, so the law is owed."
